# Regenerable instrument blobs — deterministic from (seed, config) via the
# `init` / `orders` paths, and hashed into each run's manifest. Excluded so the
# scientific record (protocols, amendments, results, per-cell JSON) stays
# committable at a sane size. See results/SUMMARY_2026-08-03.md "Version control".
results/**/init/
results/**/states/
results/**/reference-states/
results/**/workers/
results/**/orders/
*.orders
# Pinned third-party reference checkouts (Thvnvtos/SNN-delays at REFERENCE_COMMIT)
results/**/reference-worktrees/

# Third-party reference checkout and per-seed worktrees: cloned on demand
# by scripts/shd_calibration/reference.py at the pinned REFERENCE_COMMIT.
results/*/reference-cache/
results/*/reference-worktrees/

# Personal / non-research content — marketing copy and machine-local sync.
# This repo is public; keep it to the scientific record. These files stay on
# disk, they are just untracked.
# NOTE: results/BLOG_*.md are NOT marketing. They are indexed in
# results/INDEX.md and cited by RESULT_/PAPER_STATUS_ docs, so they stay tracked.
*LinkedIn*
sync_to_obsidian/
*.draft.md

# Transient flock handle from scripts/shd_calibration/runner.py; empty by
# construction and recreated on demand.
results/shd_instrument_v4/reference-cache.lock

# Generated by scripts/build_paper.py from results/PAPER_DRAFT.md.
# main.tex is generated, never edited; the PDF is reproducible from source.
paper/build/

# Written by binn-lab/src/runner.rs when a C1 run is executed from the crate
# directory (cargo test does this). Debug artwork, not a deliverable.
binn-lab/results/

